*.app
# ...but not the app project, whose folder name also ends in ".app". Git matches
# ignore patterns case-insensitively here, so *.app swallows SolsticaKalendaro.App
# and every file under it.
!src/SolsticaKalendaro.App/
*.dSYM/

# ---- Signing material: never commit any of this ----
# The Android release key lives in a GitHub Actions secret, not in the repository.
*.keystore
*.jks
*.p12
*.pfx
*.mobileprovision
*.cer
keystore.properties
secrets.json
local.properties

